OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers plead over shelter shut
OL,4,Afor five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FShivering rail passengers at a station
OL,7,Fwhere the waiting room has been closed
OL,8,Ffor five years have pleaded for
OL,9,Fshelters to be installed this winter.
OL,11,FThe Grade-II listed structure at
OL,12,FChathill Station in Northumberland was
OL,13,Fdamaged during Storm Arwen in November
OL,14,F2021 and has not reopened since.
OL,16,FNetwork Rail estimated the cost of
OL,17,Frepair at #1.4m, double the allocated
OL,18,Fbudget, as it must be dismantled and
OL,19,Frebuilt like-for-like using original
OL,20,Fmaterials.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
