OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1793355978
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers plead over shelter shut
OL,4,Afor five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA frustrated John Holwell, of Chathill
OL,7,FRail Action Group (CRAG), said:
OL,8,F"Anybody joining a train to Newcastle
OL,9,Fhas to wait in the open air, which is
OL,10,Fwonderful on a sunny June morning but
OL,11,Fnot so good in December when it's
OL,12,Fraining and it's dark."
